 e comemorações\n- Condomínio fechado com portão eletrônico e segurança\n\nLocalização & Praticidade no Campo Comprido:\n\n- Situado no bairro Campo Comprido, nas proximidades do Pequeno Cotolengo\n- Rápido e fácil acesso às Avenidas Eduardo Sprada, Ecoville e ligação direta ao bairro Batel em menos de 13 minutos\n- Região bem estruturada, cercada por supermercados, farmácias, renomados colégios, restaurantes e serviços diversos\n\nAgende sua visita com a Pizzatto Imóveis.\nValores e informações sujeitos a alteração sem prévio aviso.","fotos":["https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ae21a796c006cb45223ca6f/pilar-homes-images-watermark/4d848548-81e6-4609-9454-cd40d0d9dbc3.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ae21a796c006cb45223ca6f/pilar-homes-images-watermark/9f4ccac6-7cf9-422e-804b-e68e869290ce.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ae21a796c006cb45223ca6f/pilar-homes-images-watermark/41babaf2-564b-4d55-a992-db83ece773cb.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ae21a796c006cb45223ca6f/pilar-homes-images-watermark/7a661b82-eaf0-46e3-8281-6895fd610cc2.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ae21a796c006cb45223ca6f/pilar-homes-images-watermark/a92a6ec5-0c9d-44ea-93a4-f6f4a9f85b42.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ae21a796c006cb45223ca6f/pilar-homes-images-watermark/be7687f5-77be-4c0e-a1fa-71e8df215eae.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ae21a796c006cb45223ca6f/pilar-homes-images-watermark/191b8968-3234-4d65-9cde-4eec7d1eff55.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ae21a796c006cb45223ca6f/pilar-homes-images-watermark/bf02a973-ef76-47e5-b3d6-c37f412823e3.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ae21a796c006cb45223ca6f/pilar-homes-images-watermark/f2eb6689-e32b-4925-ba20-025b6276e9d8.jpeg","https://blintz-properties-sandbox.s3.amazonaws.com/6ae21a796c006cb45223ca6f/pilar-homes-images-watermark/3a6